An absorbed colon fence leaves a block quote's paragraph open

```
> quote
> :::note
> body
> :::
tail
.
<blockquote><p>quote
:::note
body
:::
tail</p></blockquote>
```

```
> quote
> :::note
> body
> ::::
tail
.
<blockquote><p>quote
:::note
body
::::
tail</p></blockquote>
```

```
> :::note
> :::
tail
.
<blockquote><p>:::note
:::
tail</p></blockquote>
```

```
> > quote
> > :::note
> > body
> > :::
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote><p>quote
:::note
body
:::
tail</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```
